      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hidden behind broken windows and forgotten walls lies a world frozen in time. Each abandoned place carries the whispers of stories long left behind — echoes of life, industry, and dreams now reclaimed by nature. Peeling paint becomes art, shattered glass reflects memories, and empty halls breathe with a haunting kind of beauty.",
